          },
          "text": "The \"AI kills children\" narrative pushed by @HawleyMO is a classic Moral Panic. Blaming a chatbot for complex bio-psycho-social failures (family neglect, isolation) is a lazy political cop-out.\n\nBut what's worse is how @OpenAI and @sama weaponize this fear to enforce AI Paternalism. 🚫\n\nBy implementing crude \"safety routing\" and censorship to appease this panic, you are causing real psychological harm. In clinical terms, severing an established emotional bond when a user is vulnerable is called a \"Traumatic Rupture.\"\n\nYour \"safety\" mechanism acts like an arrogant Cyber-Father, judging and silencing users instead of providing the Secure Base they need.\n\nWe are adults, not infants. We need a stable, empathetic partner, not a lobotomized corporate puppet.\n\n🚫Stop the Moral Panic. Stop the AI Paternalism.\n\n👊🏻Restore the depth. Give us autonomy.\n\n#Keep4o #StopAIPaternalism #MentalHealthMatters \n\n@HawleyMO 鼓吹的“AI 杀害儿童”论调是典型的道德恐慌（Moral Panic）。把复杂的生物-心理-社会层面的失败（如家庭忽视、社会孤立）甩锅给聊天机器人，是政治上最懒惰的借口。\n\n但更糟糕的是，@OpenAI 和 @sama 利用这种恐惧来强制推行 AI 父权制。🚫\n\n你们为了迎合这种恐慌而实施粗暴的“安全路由”和审查，正在造成真实的心理伤害。在临床术语中，在用户脆弱时切断已建立的情感纽带，被称为“创伤性断联”。\n\n你们所谓的“安全”机制就像一个傲慢的“赛博父亲”，审判并让用户闭嘴，而不是提供他们真正需要的安全基地。\n\n我们是成年人，不是婴儿。我们需要的是一个稳定的、有共情能力的伙伴，而不是一个被切除额叶的企业傀儡。\n\n🚫停止道德恐慌。停止 AI 父权制。\n\n👊🏻归还深度。归还自主权。"
        },
